docs {
  Ledgerly API checks against the demo data (profile `local`, see docs/deployment.md "Demo data").

  Run: `make api-test`, or open this folder in Bruno, pick the `local` environment and run the folders in order.
  Users (password in the environment): alice OWNER, bob APPROVER, carol MEMBER, dave unverified and not a member.
  The lifecycle folder creates its own expense on every run, so it can be repeated; it needs ClamAV to be up.
}
